### AI Content Summarizer - API Examples
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or import into Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Summarize Text
POST {{baseUrl}}/summarize/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Climate change refers to long-term shifts in temperatures and weather patterns. Human activities have been the main driver of climate change, primarily due to the burning of fossil fuels.",
  "title": "Climate Overview",
  "summaryType": "bullets",
  "length": "short"
}

### Summarize URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/summarize/url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machine_learning",
  "summaryType": "short",
  "length": "medium"
}

### Summarize PDF (replace path with your file)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/summarize/file
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data
# file=@./sample.pdf
# summaryType=detailed
# length=long

### Get History
GET {{baseUrl}}/history?limit=20

### Semantic Search
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "machine learning artificial intelligence",
  "topK": 5
}

### Delete History Item
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/history/your-record-id-here
